DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260826
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Library Card Sign-up Month - September
DESCRIPTION:WHEREAS\n\, libraries across the State of Maine are essential 
 to education\, imagination\, and opportunity\, providing early literacy pr
 ograms\, digital learning tools\, and lifelong pathways to knowledge and g
 rowth\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, Maine's libraries welcome all people\, serving as
  inclusive and accessible community spaces that connect individuals across
  cultures\, generations\, and life experiences\, and foster a strong sense
  of belonging\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, Maine's 257 public libraries reflect and 
 honor the diversity of Maine people\, honoring Wabanaki voices\, supportin
 g new Mainers\, preserving Franco-American heritage\, and uplifting rural\
 , coastal\, and urban communities alike through collections\, services and
  programs that are locally rooted\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, our libraries help Ma
 ine people navigate life's challenges by offering trusted information\, hi
 gh-speed internet\, job search and career support\, and vital connections 
 to health\, housing\, and social services – especially in communities wh
 ere other resources are limited or unavailable\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, our libr
 aries contribute to Maine's economic resilience by equipping workers\, stu
 dents\, entrepreneurs\, and small business owners with free access to trai
 ning\, online resources\, technology\, and other tools to succeed in this 
 changing world\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, through good times and bad\, Maine's lib
 rary staff have remained steadfast in their service – innovating\, adapt
 ing\, and going above and beyond to meet the evolving needs of their commu
 nities\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, a library card opens doors for every Mainer – 
 to books and broadband\, to curiosity and creativity\, to ideas and inspir
 ation\, to lifelong learning and opportunity\, to the local and global com
 munity\;\nNOW\, THEREFORE\n\, be it resolved that I\, Janet T. Mills\, Gov
 ernor of the State of Maine\, do hereby proclaim September 2026 as\nLibrar
 y Card Sign-up Month\nthroughout the State of Maine\, and I encourage all 
 Mainers to sign up for a library card and explore the many resources\, pro
 grams\, and opportu\nhttp://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_document
 s/proclamations/2026-08-library-card-sign-month-september
URL:http://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/proclamations/2
 026-08-library-card-sign-month-september
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
