SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Reminder-Upcoming Pause in Configuration Chan
 ges
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Reminder-Upcoming Pause in Configuration Changes\nRemin
 der-Upcoming Pause in Configuration Changes\nAug 24\, 2026\nThe Office of 
 MaineCare Services is launching an upgraded MIHMS\, our claims processing 
 system\, in mid-October 2026. To support system readiness activities\,\nas
  previously communicated\n\, MaineCare must temporarily pause the implemen
 tation of configuration changes from the end of August to the end of Octob
 er.\nProviders are encouraged to continue submitting the requests during t
 his period as noted in the table below.\nRequest Type\nContinue Submitting
 /Contacting\nMaineCare Action During Configuration Pause\nCoding and NDC R
 equests\nCoding:\nOMS.referencefile@maine.gov\nNDC/J-Code:\nMaineCareNDCre
 quest.DHHS@maine.gov\nMaineCare will continue to review new requests throu
 ghout the configuration pause and will write change requests (CRs) as appr
 opriate during this period. Once the configuration pause is lifted\, we wi
 ll begin implementation of the CRs .\nRate Change Requests\nMIHMSRateRqst.
 DHHS@maine.gov\nMaineCare will continue to review new requests throughout 
 the configuration pause and will write CRs as appropriate during this peri
 od. Once the configuration pause is lifted\, we will begin implementation 
 of the CRs.\nClaims and Billing\nProvider Services: 1-866-690-5585\nMaineC
 are will continue reviewing claim denials to determine whether a configura
 tion change is needed\n.\nIf a change is needed\, we will write a CR. Once
  the configuration pause is lifted\, we will begin implementation of the C
 Rs.\nWe appreciate your continued cooperation during this transition. If y
 ou have questions about the configuration pause\, please contact your\nPr
 ovider Relations Specialist\n.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/p
 rovider-bulletins/reminder-upcoming-pause-configuration-changes-2026-08-20
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/reminder-u
 pcoming-pause-configuration-changes-2026-08-20
